rls. But the most interesting is just ahead. What fate awaits Sigurd?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668780/extras/3e61378d4916f11f0384a21e01322b20.avif?t=1747812302\" data-has-big /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GAME FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 6 stylized game locations<br></li><li> A story based on the myth of Sigurd's betrayal<br></li><li> Spectacular battles<br></li><li> Procedurally generated worlds<br></li><li> Different types of weapons and types of attacks<br></li><li> Enemies of different difficulty<br></li><li> Amazing soundtrack</li></ul>",
